    <briefdescription>
<para>POSIX message queues (&lt;<ref refid="mqueue_8h" kindref="compound">mqueue.h</ref>&gt;) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides the POSIX message queue API for inter-process (or inter-thread) communication via named, persistent, prioritised message queues.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/mqueue.h.html">POSIX.1-2017 &lt;mqueue.h&gt;</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
